		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"The Ender Dragon fight in Create - Forge Frontier has been strengthened to provide a thrilling and strategic battle. Before entering the End, make sure you are fully prepared with powerful gear, plenty of supplies, and a solid strategy."
				""
				"Don't forget to use the Totem of Undying reward-it could make the difference between victory and defeat in this epic encounter. Gather your courage, sharpen your skills, and get ready to face the ultimate test! "
			]
