		{
			dependencies: ["00AABBBA631B3828"]
			description: [
				"Torn from the grasp of a mighty Sandworm, the &eOld Eye&r carries with it the enduring essence of deserts long buried by time.  "
				"It glimmers faintly with the sands of legend, waiting for one worthy to rekindle its ancient power.  "
				"To forge this relic, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and reclaim the treasures left behind by civilizations swallowed by shifting dunes.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_old_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The sands hide more than history-they guard relics touched by gods and kings alike.  "
				"The following pages will guide you on your journey across forgotten deserts and cursed ruins."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lAncient Winged Sun&r:  "
				"  An emblem of forgotten power, once worn by sun-kissed kings who ruled deserts with wisdom and might.  "
				"  Seek this sacred relic within the ancient &eDesert Pyramid&r structures of &eIntegrated Dungeons and Structures (IDAS)&r.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/idas_pyramid.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lRa’s Scepter&r:  "
				"  A divine weapon bathed in the light of the sun god himself. Its radiant power once seared across battlefields like the midday sun.  "
				"  Find this artifact hidden deep within the &eDesert Temples&r revamped by &eBetter Desert Temples&r.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/better_pyramid.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lNecklace of the Desert&r:  "
				"  A sacred charm buried within the &eCursed Pyramid&r on Venus, hidden among layers of &eSuspicious Sand&r left by the ancients.  "
				"  It is said to hold the key to awakening forces long thought lost to legend.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/cursed_pyramid.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lRemnant’s Skull&r:  "
				"  Claimed by defeating the &eAncient Remnant&r, a guardian entombed deep within the Cursed Pyramid’s heart.  "
				"  It carries the final breath of an empire lost to time, and its defeat is the final test of your resolve.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/remnant.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nThe desert is timeless, but it does not forgive.&r  "
				"Only those who endure the heat, unearth the secrets buried in sand and stone, and overcome the ancient curses will restore the &eOld Eye&r and rekindle the fire of legends long past."
			]
