		{
			description: [
				"End Remastered within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r isn’t just a mod-it’s a fully reimagined journey, meticulously overhauled to deliver an unparalleled adventure.  "
				"Every piece of its original design has been reforged, creating a progression system that is both challenging and deeply rewarding.  "
				"Prepare to embark on a quest where each step forges your legend."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l A New Era for the Eyes of Ender&r  "
				"Gone are the days of simply crafting Eyes with Blaze Powder and Ender Pearls.  "
				"In this enhanced version, every Eye is tied to a unique recipe, a distinct story, and an epic purpose.  "
				"Scattered across the farthest reaches of the world, these Eyes will lead you into forgotten ruins, perilous dungeons, and the heart of ancient mysteries.  "
				"Mastering combat, exploration, and crafting ingenuity will be essential as each Eye adds new depth and triumph to your journey."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Progression Redefined&r  "
				"To unlock the path to the End, you must gather all the Eyes by following the quests woven throughout your journey.  "
				"Each quest delivers hints, lore, and guidance-blending discovery with purpose.  "
				"Hunting down the Eyes and piecing them together to awaken the End Portal transforms your adventure into a true epic, filled with milestones and unforgettable victories."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Exclusive Features in Forge Frontier&r  "
				"This version of End Remastered is packed with custom enhancements tailored specifically for &6Create - Forge Frontier&r:"
				"- &eCustom Recipes&r: Every Eye now requires a unique crafting method that seamlessly integrates Create’s mechanical brilliance."
				"- &eDetailed Lore Descriptions&r: Each Eye is infused with rich storytelling, giving weight and meaning to every discovery."
				"- &eImmersive World Exploration&r: From sun-scorched temples to submerged ruins, your quest will stretch to every corner of the Overworld and beyond."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l The Journey Beyond the Portal&r  "
				"Activating the End Portal is not the final goal-it’s just the beginning.  "
				"Inside the End, you’ll face a dragon battle reimagined for greater challenge and strategy, pushing your skills to the limit.  "
				"Victory will unlock deeper layers of the \"End Game\" progression, unveiling powerful rewards and even greater adventures."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Forge Your Legend Among the Stars&r  "
				"End Remastered in Create - Forge Frontier is more than just an expansion-it's an odyssey.  "
				"Every Eye, every quest, and every battle is crafted to be a meaningful step in your saga.  "
				"The End is not a destination-it’s a gateway to a new horizon, where perseverance, creativity, and daring forge a legacy worthy of legend."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Venture into the unknown. Embrace the challenge.  "
				"Unravel the mysteries of the End-and write your story among the stars.   "
				"{image:ftb:textures/end_screenshot.png width:192 height:100 align:center}"
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			id: "55E1F170D9933E8F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "6DB26E5588DAF15F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 3.0d
			subtitle: "End Remastered: A New Chapter of Adventure Awaits, Click me for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5D22C1E60BB0C3FF"
				item: "minecraft:ender_eye"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Forged by the first blacksmiths at the dawn of creation, the &6Lost Eye&r stands as a testament to divine craftsmanship-an artifact glowing with the fire of the earth’s very soul.  "
				"To restore this ancient relic, you must master &lMechanical Crafting&r and gather remnants of a forgotten age.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mechancial_crafting_lost_eye.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The pieces you seek are scattered between the molten depths of the Nether and the barren ruins of &cAd Astra’s Mars&r, where ancient battles of fire and stone still echo.  "
				"The next few pages will guide you to reclaim the tools of the ancients."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lInfernal Forge&r and &lMonstrous Horn&r:  "
				"  Both are prized trophies obtained by defeating the fearsome &eNetherite Monstrosity&r, a creature of molten rage found lurking within the &eSoul Blacksmith&r structure on Mars.  "
				"  Its defeat is no small feat-steel your spirit and prepare for battle against a relic of chaos.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/smith.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lChisel of the Deep Forge&r:  "
				"  Crafted in silence beneath the world’s crust, this legendary chisel shapes not just stone-but destiny itself.  "
				"  It can be unearthed from the sacred ruins hidden among &eMars Temple&r treasures.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/mars_temple.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lAncient Debris&r:  "
				"  Raw fragments of creation’s earliest forges, Ancient Debris can be found deep in the Nether, especially near &eDebris Molten Vents&r located on the Nether Roof, or naturally between &eY-Level 15&r and below.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/debris_vent.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nOnly those who can endure fire and fury may claim the Lost Eye.&r  "
				"The path will test your mettle, your will, and your soul. But those who succeed will wield a relic forged by gods-the ember of creation itself, reborn through your triumph."
			]
